                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.2315/319: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Poindexter</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-10-04T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 4,
                                1926—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>71. Your 84, October 2, 4 p.m. I agree with you and leave the whole matter to
                    your discretion.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
